	optdepends = neoarch: Add/Remove software in the root menu
	optdepends = jumpapp-ng: app launch/focus keybinds (AUR)
	optdepends = wl-screenrec: screen recording keybind (AUR)
	optdepends = ffmpeg: converter menu
	optdepends = gifski: converter GIF output
	optdepends = colormenu: Built-in palettes for the Colors panel, colors shared with the Openbox session
	optdepends = wl-clipboard: paste-ready note copy and music URLs
